  "description": "Conversion of the garage into a study and plant room, including the replacement of the roof and front/rear doors; replacement of the kitchen roof with a pitched roof and the french doors with crittall style doors; conversion of the ground floor shower room to a pantry and office to a bathroom; installation of a new lintel above the dining room window; conversion of the small first floor front room to an en-suite, including a jib door to the master bedroom; replacement of the timber gate with a traditional handmade iron gate; and removal/replacement of the cement render with lime render to the front facade. (Please note: The reference number for this Listed Building Consent application is 26/00614/LB but there is also an associated application for Full Planning Permission related to these works with reference number: 26/00613/FUL).",
